{"title": "Infernal Alloy", "pageid": 6216, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_Alloy", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png/300px-Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Alloy image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png/300px-Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Infernal Alloy</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The ridges in this metal glow faintly, drawing your gaze. The longer you watch its hellish pulsations, the harder it is to remember who and where you are.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 100 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  100  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c88f0872cf9f4b87END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bc1a464f327e7ec8END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-410ebff5ff9deb7fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_UND_InfernalPlate_Reward</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_InfernalPlate_Reward\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_InfernalPlate_Reward\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">28722ffc-9261-4f8b-ad7b-3f7bcd1ad54a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:28722ffc-9261-4f8b-ad7b-3f7bcd1ad54a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:28722ffc-9261-4f8b-ad7b-3f7bcd1ad54a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_InfernalPlate</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_InfernalPlate+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_InfernalPlate+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Obtained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/25px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/38px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/50px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stonemason Kith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/25px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\">Stonemason Kith</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Infernal Alloy can be used in place of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Iron\" title=\"Infernal Iron\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Infernal_Alloy_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Iron\" title=\"Infernal Iron\">Infernal Iron</a> to craft <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Armour\">Flawed Helldusk Armour</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Helmet\">Flawed Helldusk Helmet</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Gloves\">Flawed Helldusk Gloves</a>. To do so, the party can give Infernal Alloy to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/38px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/50px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dammon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a> and select the dialogue option <i>\"I found this metal in a place called Grymforge - what do you make of it?\"</i>. By prompting this three times the entire set is crafted for the party, freeing up the Infernal Iron required for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach's</a> questline <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hellion%27s_Heart\" title=\"The Hellion's Heart\">The Hellion's Heart</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Kith rewards the party with the alloy if they help him investigate the area, by succeeding on all three <a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\">History</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Investigation\" title=\"Investigation\">Investigation</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks while talking to him. If the three checks are not succeeded, the Infernal Alloy can still be obtained by purchasing it from him or by looting it from his corpse.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Iron\" title=\"Infernal Iron\">Infernal Iron</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Metal\" title=\"Infernal Metal\">Infernal Metal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enriched_Infernal_Iron\" title=\"Enriched Infernal Iron\">Enriched Infernal Iron</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3458/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46425/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13340/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1208439/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   71.927      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   71.927      1 -total\n 40.43%   29.077     43 Template:Trim\n 39.49%   28.407      8 Template:Icon_text\n 26.89%   19.341      4 Template:Item_icon\n 20.32%   14.614      3 Template:Uid\n 19.47%   14.006      3 Template:RarityItem\n 11.50%    8.271     16 Template:Ifempty\n 11.40%    8.200      4 Template:Icon_link\n 10.24%    7.368      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6216-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200446 and revision id 387500. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}